{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "recsys-serving",
  "title": "Recsys · serving",
  "description": "The orchestrator's five stages against their budgets, the funnel, the four named degradations, arm balance and the impression log. Every threshold here mirrors serving/monitoring/alerts.yml, so a red panel and a firing alert cannot disagree. Scrape job: recsys-orchestrator at recsys-host:9102.",
  "tags": [
    "recsys",
    "serving"
  ],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "10s",
      "30s",
      "1m",
      "5m",
      "15m"
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Budget",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "p99 end to end",
      "description": "RecsysP99OverBudget fires past 100ms for 5m. The 90ms figure in docs/design.md is the BUDGET; the alert sits at 100ms so a brief excursion is not a page.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "#EAB839",
                "value": 0.09
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 3
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(recsys_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99 end to end",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Fallback rate",
      "description": "Share of OK slates that are the popularity list. RecsysFallbackRate pages past 5%. A healthy-looking service at 97% fallback is the exact failure Part M's first run hit.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "#EAB839",
                "value": 0.01
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.05
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 3
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(recsys_fallback_total[5m]))\n  / clamp_min(sum(rate(recsys_requests_total{code=\"OK\"}[5m])), 0.001)",
          "legendFormat": "Fallback rate",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Server error rate",
      "description": "RecsysErrorRate pages past 1%. InvalidArgument is excluded here and tracked on its own, because a malformed-request spike is a caller bug, not an outage. The numerator is `or vector(0)`-ed: recsys_requests_total is labelled by code, so with no errors the selector matches NO series and sum() over nothing is empty, not zero -- which Grafana renders as 'No data', indistinguishable from the metric having disappeared.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.01
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 4
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(sum(rate(recsys_requests_total{code!~\"OK|InvalidArgument\"}[5m])) or vector(0))\n  / clamp_min(sum(rate(recsys_requests_total[5m])), 0.001)",
          "legendFormat": "Server error rate",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Feature store age",
      "description": "Seconds behind the stalest materialised Feast view, from the gateway's readiness probe. 0 means no reading yet, NOT fresh. §16.1 wants an alert past 10 minutes. ⚠️ ON MIND THIS READS ~7 YEARS AND IS CORRECT: the corpus's event timestamps are from 2019 and this is measured against wall-clock now. Same event-time-vs-wall-clock gap as the retention.ms=-1 decision in make/kafka.mk. The §16.1 alert therefore CANNOT be enabled on this corpus without either measuring against the corpus's own max timestamp or pinning a reference clock -- an unresolved decision, not a panel bug.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "#EAB839",
                "value": 300
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 600
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(recsys_feature_store_age_seconds)",
          "legendFormat": "Feature store age",
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
